# EXPECT-SUBSTRING: trong than 'try' khi co 'finally:'
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
# `break`/`continue` trong than TRY khi co `finally:` PHAI bi tu choi.
#
# Do bang probe doi chieu CPython (2026-09-30): truoc khi co guard nay, truong
# hop nay BIEN DICH THANH CONG nhung sinh IL SAI - chay thi nem
# `InvalidProgramException: Common Language Runtime detected an invalid
# program`. Python tra ket qua dung: 3 lan finally chay roi `break` o i==2.
#
# Cac guard sẵn co chi chan `break` trong `finally:` va trong `else` cua try -
# CHUA chan thang nay. Do ma no khong bao loi luc bien dich ma chi sup luc
# chay, nen phai chan.
def run() -> "i32":
    n = 0
    for i in range(5):
        try:
            if i == 2:
                break
        finally:
            n = n + 1
    return n
